diff --git a/README.md b/README.md
index b5fe1b2a4feac926b16f4b55fd72f2bb6eb7b711..9933574c1cc9173e5dc366147475f4cc2d76f78b 100644
--- a/README.md
+++ b/README.md
@@ -3,3 +3,23 @@
 The Lakeside Windsurf School teaches windsurfing on the lake from April to October, and rents boards and
 sails to its students and to visitors who bring their own experience. This repository holds the software
 of its booking desk, written in TypeScript with no runtime dependency.
+
+## Rental module
+
+`createRentalService()` (exported from `src/index.ts`) keeps equipment and bookings in memory:
+
+- `addEquipment({ id, kind, dailyPrice })` registers a board or sail, with its daily price in integer
+  euro cents.
+- `quote({ itemId, start, end })` returns the cost of renting an item for a period, without booking it.
+- `book({ itemId, start, end })` books the item for the period and returns the booking, including its
+  `id`.
+
+A period is a pair of UTC midnight ISO-8601 timestamps: it starts at midnight on its first day and ends
+at midnight on the day after its last day. `quote` and `book` throw for an unknown item or a period that
+does not fit this shape; `book` also throws if the item is already booked for part of that period.
+Cancellation is not implemented yet.
+
+## Development
+
+- `npm run build` compiles `src` and `test` to `dist`.
+- `npm test` builds and runs the test suite with Node's built-in test runner.
